      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "これはエンタープライズ……。\r\n破棄されたと思ってた……。",
        "official_en": "It’s...the <text style=\"italic\">Enterprise</>... I thought she was destroyed.",
        "real_en": "It's the <text style=\"italic\">Enterprise</>... I thought it'd been scrapped..."
