      "text": {
        "jp": "まだ完成はしていないが、\r\nそれでも飛行速度だけなら\r\nインビンシブルをも上回る性能がある。",
        "official_en": "She’s still not up to specs, but if it’s a question of speed, I bet she can outpace the <text style=\"italic\">Invincible</>.",
        "real_en": "It's not finished yet, but its flight speed alone surpasses even the <text style=\"italic\">Invincible</>."
